  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Hàm số xác định khi và chỉ khi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Tập xác định <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒟</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>∞</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Hàm số xác định khi và chỉ khi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇔</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow></semantics></math><br>Tập xác định <math displa